ありますが、🐢様のお好きなものを選んでいただけますと幸いです。\n\n頂いたイラストの使用用途としましては個人的なグッズ作成等の、個人鑑賞用です。\n\nご検討よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ZVFIiNb6nMPnAH_32t6jgn6dbJZg2sxK?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@10omt/works/7", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3bfe31ce/uploads/origins/57493800-d313-45ab-b4ad-c812acd915b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4ba8402b2c0bfaecf972826660f26d3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3bfe31ce/uploads/origins/57493800-d313-45ab-b4ad-c812acd915b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4ba8402b2c0bfaecf972826660f26d3, https://si.imgix.net/3bfe31ce/uploads/origins/57493800-d313-45ab-b4ad-c812acd915b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64ffb37c5aa485f9f9ec8f25c068877d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3bfe31ce/uploads/origins/57493800-d313-45ab-b4ad-c812acd915b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9930182bbaa6b40cc9024854dff08ad4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のキャラを自由な解釈で描いてくれませんか...！雰囲気、改変などはご自由に変更してください！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Qqnpoma0YSiecGCUt2ekBTG6mfuDrNmF", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@10omt/works/6", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e6ddd7c3/uploads/origins/d5b87258-4ae3-4c39-8857-54e653ffa796?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56eb6d1eace60e4c91e450c9131cd979", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e6ddd7c3/uploads/origins/d5b87258-4ae3-4c39-8857-54e653ffa796?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56eb6d1eace60e4c91e450c9131cd979, https://si.imgix.net/e6ddd7c3/uploads/origins/d5b87258-4ae3-4c39-8857-54e653ffa796?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=122ec3